# Maven / Shell approvals

When running backend tests in this repo:

1. Prefer Shell `working_directory`: `/home/suso/job-learn/apps/backend`
2. Prefer command form starting with `./mvnw` (not `cd ... && ./mvnw ...`)
3. Do **not** set `required_permissions: ["all"]` or `full_network` on the first attempt
4. Only escalate permissions after a real sandbox failure, and only if the failure message indicates sandbox/network/docker limits
